-- ============================================================================
-- AIS Website - PostgreSQL schema + sample data
-- ============================================================================
-- Mirrors the SQLAlchemy models in backend-python/app/models.py exactly
-- (table/column names, types, nullability, FKs, indexes).
--
-- Not required for normal local/docker-compose use: the FastAPI app already
-- creates these tables (Base.metadata.create_all()) and seeds minimal demo
-- data (app/seed.py) automatically on startup. Run this script manually
-- against ais_db (e.g. via psql) when you want a richer, standalone dataset
-- for demos, manual QA, or reporting - it is idempotent (each insert is
-- guarded by an emptiness check, same pattern as app/seed.py) so running it
-- again, or starting the app afterwards, will not create duplicate rows.
--
-- Usage:
--   psql -h localhost -U ais_app_user -d ais_db -f scripts/schema-and-seed-data.sql
-- ============================================================================

